  "title": "Ex 5.18 · (a + b)³ ≡ a³ + b³ (mod 3)",
  "prompt": "Let $a, b$ be integers. Prove that $(a + b)^3 \\equiv a^3 + b^3 \\pmod 3$, that is, $3 \\mid \\big((a+b)^3 - (a^3 + b^3)\\big)$.",
  "answer_format": "A structured proof: let, case, expr and witness steps (notes optional). No final answer box.",
  "difficulty": 1,
